"external_author": null,
"note": "Closing other repeated issue\n\nTitle: SMF Selection in case of UE ip-address allocation via UDM\n\nTo use the UE ip-address allocation via the database we need to set SMF_SELECTION to no in this method NRF will not be used. This method breaks the continuity and mixes the reference point and service based architecture. It will be good to find a mechanism to do it via NRF.",
"note_html": "<p data-sourcepos=\"1:1-1:28\" dir=\"auto\">Closing other repeated issue</p>\n<p data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:64\" dir=\"auto\">Title: SMF Selection in case of UE ip-address allocation via UDM</p>\n<p data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:274\" dir=\"auto\">To use the UE ip-address allocation via the database we need to set SMF_SELECTION to no in this method NRF will not be used. This method breaks the continuity and mixes the reference point and service based architecture. It will be good to find a mechanism to do it via NRF.</p>",
"body_first_line_html": "<p>Closing other repeated issue...</p>",
